/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Frugal innovation is not just about cost-cutting; it is about reimagining processes, products, and systems to create value under constraints. It thrives on simplicity, adaptability, and a deep understanding of local needs. By fostering collaboration across sectors and embracing resourcefulness, frugal innovation has empowered communities in both developed and emerging economies to tackle their most pressing challenges.)
/E (Frugal innovation is not just about cost-cutting; it is about reimagining processes, products, and systems to create value under constraints. It thrives on simplicity, adaptability, and a deep understanding of local needs. By fostering collaboration across sectors and embracing resourcefulness, frugal innovation has empowered communities in both developed and emerging economies to tackle their most pressing challenges.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
