/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (This whitepaper is a timely contribution to the ongoing discourse on responsible AI development. It underscores the importance of aligning technological advancements with societal goals and environmental sustainability. As you explore its insights and recommendations, I encourage you to reflect on how we can collectively harness the power of Frugal AI to create a fairer and more sustainable future.)
/E (This whitepaper is a timely contribution to the ongoing discourse on responsible AI development. It underscores the importance of aligning technological advancements with societal goals and environmental sustainability. As you explore its insights and recommendations, I encourage you to reflect on how we can collectively harness the power of Frugal AI to create a fairer and more sustainable future.)
