219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The transformative potential of Artificial Intelligence is undeniable, yet its current trajectory raises urgent questions. While AI drives innovation across sectors, its development is increasingly characterized by resource intensity. The training of large language models can consume energy equivalent to the annual consumption of over 100 homes, and the global electricity consumption of data centers rivals that of entire countries. This immense appetite for energy and computation translates into a significant environmental footprint and prohibitive costs, creating barriers to entry and hindering widespread adoption. )
/E (The transformative potential of Artificial Intelligence is undeniable, yet its current trajectory raises urgent questions. While AI drives innovation across sectors, its development is increasingly characterized by resource intensity. The training of large language models can consume energy equivalent to the annual consumption of over 100 homes, and the global electricity consumption of data centers rivals that of entire countries. This immense appetite for energy and computation translates into a significant environmental footprint and prohibitive costs, creating barriers to entry and hindering widespread adoption. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
