/P 597 0 R
/E (Accessibility & Inclusion: A core goal of Frugal AI is to democratize access to AI capabilities. This involves designing lightweight models deployable on low-power edge devices \(smartphones, IoT sensors\) and in resource-constrained environments. It aims to lower technical and financial barriers, making AI tools available and beneficial to SMEs, non-profits, emerging markets, and diverse user groups, thereby bridging the digital divide and ensuring fairness. )
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
