/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Frugal AI Self-Assessment Framework: This framework allows organizations to evaluate their maturity across key dimensions of Frugal AI, including sustainable data centers, AI efficiency techniques, energy scoring, handling constraints, ROI/TCO calculation, scalability, ecosystem engagement, inclusivity, and impact focus. It provides a structured way to identify strengths and areas for improvement. )
/E (Frugal AI Self-Assessment Framework: This framework allows organizations to evaluate their maturity across key dimensions of Frugal AI, including sustainable data centers, AI efficiency techniques, energy scoring, handling constraints, ROI/TCO calculation, scalability, ecosystem engagement, inclusivity, and impact focus. It provides a structured way to identify strengths and areas for improvement. )
